{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2d136792-54d6-4752-9ef9-55abacfd47ed",
    "name": "mani_qas01_perimetro_scrum_1266",
    "description": "SCRUM-1266. QA-MON-01 (healthchecks y correlation id) y QAS-01 caso 5 (token ausente, mal formado, alterado o vencido) mas la exposicion de dev-token, por el Gateway de QA. Los casos 1 a 4 y 6 de QAS-01 no tienen endpoints reales en QA (Core release es stub). Variables de ambiente: base_url, token, token_vencido (opcional).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "qa_mon_01_healthchecks",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 Gateway health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('status UP', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('UP'); });",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('propaga X-Correlation-ID', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Correlation-ID')).to.eql(pm.request.headers.get('X-Correlation-ID'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Correlation-ID",
                "value": "qa1266-newman-{{$guid}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health"
          }
        },
        {
